Goal:
  (and (shipped o1) (shipped o10) (shipped o11) (shipped o12) (shipped o13) (shipped o14) (shipped o2) (shipped o3) (shipped o4) (shipped o5) (shipped o6) (shipped o7) (shipped o8) (shipped o9))
Metric:
  (total-cost)
Pred prop:
  (includes order product): in_init in_pre
  (made product): in_pre in_pre_neg in_eff
  (next-count count count): in_init in_pre
  (shipped order): in_goal in_eff
  (stacks-avail count): in_init in_pre in_eff
  (started order): in_pre in_eff
  (waiting order): in_init in_pre in_eff
Func prop:
